              </article>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- if product.handle contains 'ct1' or product.title contains 'Fluted Pillar' -%}
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>November 2026</time></div><h3>Majestic architectural center table</h3><p>Absolutely majestic center table. The fluted gold pillars at the four corners give it such an architectural, luxurious look. The black marble surface is heavy and gorgeous with realistic gold and white veins.</p><span class="product-review-author">Hamza Tariq (Lahore)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>November 2026</time></div><h3>Elevated our entire drawing room</h3><p>We placed this in our main drawing room between our 8-seater sofa set and it completely elevated the entire room. The double-tier storage is very practical.</p><span class="product-review-author">Dr. Naila Arshad (Islamabad)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>October 2026</time></div><h3>Top-notch quality &amp; secure packing</h3><p>Top-notch quality. I was a bit worried about shipping a marble table to Karachi, but the packaging had thick corner guards and bubble wrap. Perfectly intact.</p><span class="product-review-author">Zubair Ahmed (Karachi)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★☆</span><time>October 2026</time></div><h3>Very solid build &amp; heavy marble</h3><p>Very solid build and lovely aesthetics. Slightly heavier than I expected which is actually great because it doesn't wobble at all on the carpet.</p><span class="product-review-author">Saira Bano (Rawalpindi)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>October 2026</time></div><h3>Italian luxury look at fair price</h3><p>Gull e Gulzar never disappoints. The fluted pillar detailing looks like high-end imported Italian furniture. The price of Rs. 18,500 is completely justified.</p><span class="product-review-author">Kamran Farooq (Faisalabad)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>September 2026</time></div><h3>Flawless finish</h3><p>Everything from the polish on the marble to the sturdy gold frame is flawless. Fits perfectly in our living room.</p><span class="product-review-author">Bilal Siddiqui (Peshawar)</span></article>
          {%- elsif product.handle contains 'ct2' or product.title contains 'Stepped' -%}
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>November 2026</time></div><h3>Stepped dual-level design is genius</h3><p>The stepped dual-level design is genius! I keep a small money plant on the lower tier and serving trays on the top tier. The vertical gold rods give it a very sleek contemporary aesthetic.</p><span class="product-review-author">Usman Ghani (Karachi)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>November 2026</time></div><h3>Exceeded all my expectations</h3><p>Exceeded all my expectations! The black gold marble looks super luxurious and the warm gold finish matches my living room theme perfectly.</p><span class="product-review-author">Ayesha Siddiqa (Lahore)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>October 2026</time></div><h3>Unique designer furniture look</h3><p>Very unique design that you don't find easily in local furniture markets. The split-level layout makes it look like designer furniture.</p><span class="product-review-author">Fahad Alvi (Islamabad)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★☆</span><time>October 2026</time></div><h3>Sturdy &amp; multi-functional</h3><p>The table is beautiful and sturdy. The stepped shelves allow multiple decorative pieces without looking cluttered.</p><span class="product-review-author">Hafsa Munir (Gujranwala)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>October 2026</time></div><h3>Durable gold coating &amp; easy to clean</h3><p>The gold coating is durable and hasn't scratched. Black marble top wipes clean with a microfibre cloth without any water marks.</p><span class="product-review-author">Omer Sheikh (Lahore)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>September 2026</time></div><h3>Modern &amp; minimalist</h3><p>Modern, minimalist yet opulent. The split height tiers add great depth to our living room space.</p><span class="product-review-author">Taimoor Shah (Rawalpindi)</span></article>
          {%- elsif product.handle contains 'ct3' or product.title contains 'Oval' -%}
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>November 2026</time></div><h3>Safe oval shape &amp; child-friendly corners</h3><p>The oval capsule shape is fantastic, especially because we have toddlers running around and there are no sharp 90-degree corners. The vertical cage bars look sensational.</p><span class="product-review-author">Farhan Qureshi (Lahore)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>November 2026</time></div><h3>Straight out of an interior design magazine</h3><p>Looks straight out of an Architectural Digest magazine! The dark marble top with deep undertones and the curved gold ribbed frame make it a true showstopper.</p><span class="product-review-author">Zainab Meer (Karachi)</span></article>
