            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>September 2026</time></div><h3>Elite curved cage styling</h3><p>Excellent product quality and prompt customer service. The rounded cage style gives it such an elite look.</p><span class="product-review-author">Adeel Hassan (Lahore)</span></article>
          {%- elsif product.handle contains 'ct4' or product.title contains 'Spiral' or product.title contains 'Geometric' -%}
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>November 2026</time></div><h3>Best value furniture piece in Pakistan</h3><p>At Rs. 10,500 this is the best value furniture piece in Pakistan right now! The twisted geometric wireframe base looks hypnotic and modern. Solid black marble top too.</p><span class="product-review-author">Daniyal Aslam (Lahore)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>November 2026</time></div><h3>Spiral sunburst base is a conversation starter</h3><p>The spiral sunburst metal base is an absolute conversation starter. Everyone who walks into our lounge notices it immediately. Clean marble top.</p><span class="product-review-author">Rabia Imran (Karachi)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>October 2026</time></div><h3>Incredible geometric design</h3><p>Incredible geometric design! Looks much more expensive than 10.5k. The gold powder coating is smooth and the marble has nice natural veining.</p><span class="product-review-author">Salman Zafar (Islamabad)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★☆</span><time>October 2026</time></div><h3>Adds so much character to the lounge</h3><p>Very pretty and modern center table. The sunburst spiral detail underneath adds so much character. Delivery was quick and packaging was secure.</p><span class="product-review-author">Hina Kashif (Rawalpindi)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>October 2026</time></div><h3>Low profile &amp; airy design</h3><p>Bought this for our apartment living room. Its low profile and airy wireframe base make the room feel open and spacious while still looking very luxury.</p><span class="product-review-author">Shahid Nawaz (Multan)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>September 2026</time></div><h3>Great build quality &amp; fair pricing</h3><p>Great build quality, unique geometric spiral center, and very fair pricing. Gull e Gulzar's finishing is always top tier.</p><span class="product-review-author">Arslan Khalid (Faisalabad)</span></article>
          {%- elsif product.type == 'Console Tables' or product.handle contains 'console' -%}
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>November 2026</time></div><h3>Magnificent entrance console</h3><p>Placed this in our entryway hall and everyone who visits compliments it. The gold frame is sturdy and the marble finish is very rich.</p><span class="product-review-author">Bilal Tariq (Lahore)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>November 2026</time></div><h3>Stunning design &amp; flawless delivery</h3><p>Arrived within 4 days to Lahore. Very securely packed with protective corners. The console table is truly a piece of art.</p><span class="product-review-author">Nida Rehman (Karachi)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>October 2026</time></div><h3>Top-grade craftsmanship</h3><p>The geometric structure is rock solid and perfectly balanced. Looks like high-end imported Turkish or Italian furniture.</p><span class="product-review-author">Kashif Mehmood (Islamabad)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★☆</span><time>October 2026</time></div><h3>Very elegant and space-saving</h3><p>Slim profile fits perfectly along our hallway wall without blocking passage. The tabletop is easy to keep spotless.</p><span class="product-review-author">Sadia Farhan (Rawalpindi)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>October 2026</time></div><h3>Exceeded all expectations</h3><p>Worth every rupee of Rs. 13,000. Customer service on WhatsApp was prompt and helpful with order confirmation.</p><span class="product-review-author">Waseem Akram (Faisalabad)</span></article>
            <article class="product-review-card"><div class="product-review-card-top"><span class="product-rating-stars">★★★★★</span><time>September 2026</time></div><h3>Premium aesthetic for our home</h3><p>We styled it with a mirror above and decorative vases, and it transformed the foyer. Absolutely love it!</p><span class="product-review-author">Anum Jahangir (Multan)</span></article>
